---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastReviewed = '11 September 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Master Services Agreement, All Webbed Labs"
  description="AW Labs Pty Ltd's Master Services Agreement — the umbrella terms that govern each Schedule of Work or Care Plan entered into with our clients."
  noindex={true}
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="policy-section">
      <div class="policy-inner">
        <div class="policy-header reveal">
          <span class="section-label">Legal</span>
          <h1>Master Services Agreement</h1>
          <p class="policy-meta">Version dated {lastReviewed} · AW Labs Pty Ltd · ABN 32 698 684 105</p>

          <div class="policy-actions">
            <a
              href="/client-pack/msa.pdf"
              class="btn-primary msa-btn"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
            >
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
              Open the MSA (PDF)
            </a>
            <a
              href="/client-pack/msa.pdf"
              class="msa-download"
              download="AWLabs-Master-Services-Agreement.pdf"
            >
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
              Download PDF
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-content reveal stagger-1">
          <p class="policy-lead">
            This page hosts our Master Services Agreement (MSA) for your review. It is the
            umbrella agreement that governs the relationship between AW Labs Pty Ltd
            (<strong>All Webbed Labs</strong>) and each of our clients. Every individual project,
            retainer or Care Plan we take on is documented in a separate Schedule of Work (SOW)
            that sits underneath this MSA.
          </p>

          <p>
            The MSA is 48 pages of full legal terms. Reviewing it before you commit is
            encouraged, not required — take as long as you need, share it with your advisers,
            and come back with any questions before we prepare an SOW for your project.
          </p>

          <h2>What the MSA covers</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Operative framework — how the MSA, SOWs, Discovery Audits and Variations fit together.</li>
            <li>Service standard, personnel, subcontractors and third-party platforms.</li>
            <li>Client obligations, dependencies and approvals.</li>
            <li>Infrastructure, account ownership, administrative access and security.</li>
            <li>Fees, invoicing, milestones and payment terms.</li>
            <li>Director's guarantee (where the Client is a corporation).</li>
            <li>Scope control, variations and change management.</li>
            <li>Development, testing, acceptance and handover.</li>
            <li>30-day post-launch warranty and support obligations.</li>
            <li>Intellectual property, including payment-linked assignment of Project IP.</li>
            <li>AI-assisted services, confidentiality, privacy and data handling.</li>
            <li>Independent professional advisers (legal, accounting, tax).</li>
            <li>Marketing, hosting, maintenance and Care Plans.</li>
            <li>Warranties, Australian Consumer Law, limitation of liability.</li>
            <li>Term, termination, dispute resolution, governing law and general provisions.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>When and how it is signed</h2>
          <p>
            You are not signing anything by opening this page. The MSA is executed once, at the
            start of the commercial relationship, and is then reused across every project or
            retainer we run together — you do not sign a new set of general terms each time.
          </p>
          <p>
            When you are ready to proceed, we prepare a Schedule of Work for the specific project
            and issue the MSA for signature alongside it. Signing is done electronically.
          </p>

          <h2>Questions or amendments</h2>
          <p>
            If anything in the MSA is unclear, or if your legal or procurement team needs a
            particular clause adjusted, email
            <a href="mailto:admin@awlabs.com.au">admin@awlabs.com.au</a> or reply to whoever sent
            you this link. We are happy to walk through the document with you and consider
            reasonable amendments recorded in writing.
          </p>

          <hr class="policy-rule" />

          <p class="policy-foot">
            This page is a review portal only and is not linked from the public site. The
            authoritative document is the signed PDF version above. In the event of any
            inconsistency between this summary page and the PDF, the PDF prevails.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .policy-section { padding: 9rem 0 6rem; background: #0a0f0e; min-height: 80vh; }
  .policy-inner { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
  .policy-header { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .policy-header h1 {
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: white;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .policy-meta {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #6b8478;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .policy-actions {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .msa-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .msa-download {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #8aa09a;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2a3d35;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .msa-download:hover {
    color: #0d9373;
    border-color: rgba(13, 147, 115, 0.6);
  }
  .msa-download svg { flex-shrink: 0; }

  .policy-content h2 {
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: white;
    margin: 2.75rem 0 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .policy-content p,
  .policy-content li {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9625rem;
    color: #cde0da;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .policy-content p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .policy-content ul { margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem 1.25rem; padding: 0; }
  .policy-content ul li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .policy-content strong { color: white; font-weight: 600; }
  .policy-content a {
    color: #0d9373;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(13, 147, 115, 0.4);
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .policy-content a:hover { border-color: #0d9373; color: #14b58e; }

  .policy-lead {
    font-size: 1.0625rem !important;
    line-height: 1.7 !important;
    color: #e1eee9 !important;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #0d9373;
    background: rgba(13, 147, 115, 0.06);
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0 !important;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
  }

  .policy-rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    margin: 3rem 0 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .policy-foot {
    font-size: 0.875rem !important;
    color: rgba(205, 224, 218, 0.65) !important;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
